{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06745","headline":"酬鸿胪裴主簿雨後北楼见赠 · 王昌龄","name":"酬鸿胪裴主簿雨後北楼见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮霞照新晴，归云犹相逐。\n有怀晨昏暇，想见登眺目。\n问礼侍彤襜，题诗访茅屋。\n高楼多古今，陈事满陵谷。\n地久微子封，台余孝王筑。\n裴回顾霄汉，豁达俯川陆。\n远水对孤城，长天向乔木。\n公门何清静，列戟森已肃。\n不叹携手稀，常思着鞭速。\n终当拂羽翰，轻举随鸿鹄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06745.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06745","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}